               <div class="mt-4 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="hcc-news-article-teaser">	<h2 class='text-base uppercase font-bold text-black'><a href='/about/get-to-know-harford/news/2026/11-nov/harford-celebrates-gis-day.php' class='hcc-link-reset'>Celebrate GIS Day!</a></h2>		<div class="grid gap-4 grid-cols-12">			<div class="col-span-4">				<a href='/about/get-to-know-harford/news/2026/11-nov/harford-celebrates-gis-day.php' class='hcc-link-reset'>					<img src='https://www.harford.edu/_images/_news/cal/2026/11-nov/gis-day-300x300.jpg' alt='Harford Community College Celebrates GIS Day'>				</a>			</div>			<div class="col-span-8">				<p class='leading-tight'>Harford will observe GIS Day on November 18, 9 AM-1 PM in Edgewood Hall, Room 132. The event is free and open to the public, but registration is required.  This annual international occasion celebrates the impactful work of Geographic Information Systems and Geospatial Technology professionals.</p>				<div class="flex justify-end">					<a href='/about/get-to-know-harford/news/2026/11-nov/harford-celebrates-gis-day.php' class='hcc-action'>Read More</a>				</div>			</div>		</div></div><div class="hcc-news-article-teaser">	<h2 class='text-base uppercase font-bold text-black'><a href='/about/get-to-know-harford/news/2026/11-nov/harford-leadership-academy-applications-now-open.php' class='hcc-link-reset'>Apply Now for Harford Leadership Academy</a></h2>		<div class="grid gap-4 grid-cols-12">			<div class="col-span-4">				<a href='/about/get-to-know-harford/news/2026/11-nov/harford-leadership-academy-applications-now-open.php' class='hcc-link-reset'>					<img src='/_images/_news/2026/11-nov/leadership-300x300.jpg' alt='Apply Now for Harford Leadership Academy'>				</a>			</div>			<div class="col-span-8">				<p class='leading-tight'>Join the ranks of more than 1,000 local leaders from business and industry, education, government, nonprofit, and civic organizations who have graduated from the Harford Leadership Academy. Existing and emerging leaders in Harford County may apply online now through January 8.</p>				<div class="flex justify-end">					<a href='/about/get-to-know-harford/news/2026/11-nov/harford-leadership-academy-applications-now-open.php' class='hcc-action'>Read More</a>				</div>			</div>		</div></div><div class="hcc-news-article-teaser">	<h2 class='text-base uppercase font-bold text-black'><a href='/about/get-to-know-harford/news/2026/11-nov/words-and-other-mistakes-exhibit-to-open.php' class='hcc-link-reset'>New Art Exhibit Opens</a></h2>		<div class="grid gap-4 grid-cols-12">			<div class="col-span-4">				<a href='/about/get-to-know-harford/news/2026/11-nov/words-and-other-mistakes-exhibit-to-open.php' class='hcc-link-reset'>					<img src='https://www.harford.edu/_images/_news/cal/2027/11-nov/martin-brief-300x300.jpg' alt='Words and Other Mistakes Exhibit to Open in the LaCalle Chesapeake Gallery'>				</a>			</div>			<div class="col-span-8">				<p class='leading-tight'>“Words and Other Mistakes,” an exhibition by internationally recognized artist Martin Brief, is on display now through December 20 in the LaCalle Chesapeake Gallery. The public is invited to an opening reception on November 19, 6-7:30 PM, also to be held in the LaCalle Chesapeake Gallery.</p>				<div class="flex justify-end">					<a href='/about/get-to-know-harford/news/2026/11-nov/words-and-other-mistakes-exhibit-to-open.php' class='hcc-action'>Read More</a>				</div>			</div>		</div></div></div>
